#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 4178d07b327f4bb2b57dfb746b7cc87b Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:9 and
msgid "Ranking Long and Short Signals"
msgstr "排名做多和做空信号"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. Long Ranking Short Signals.ipynb:11 and
#: db0579de095d4602b27c9a43911f75c4
msgid ""
"In this notebook, you will learn how to rank long and short signals "
"across ticker symbols."
msgstr "在本文档中，你将学习如何对各股票代码的多头和空头信号进行排名。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 1273955eb54943a29cbea4741413c111 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:61 and
msgid "Long Signals"
msgstr "多头信号"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. Long Ranking Short Signals.ipynb:63 and
#: f10e0cf03b874e8a839c041cb9f9f0d1
msgid ""
"Let's begin with an example of how to rank ticker symbols based on volume"
" when placing buy orders:"
msgstr "让我们从一个示例开始，说明如何在下买单时根据成交量对股票代码进行排名："

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. Long Ranking Short Signals.ipynb:89 and
#: c33d7d50c0da4c6b854e26a266969914
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The ``buy_highest_volume`` function allocates 100% of the portfolio and "
"holds for 2 bars. It sets ``ctx.long_score`` to ``ctx.volume[-1]`` so "
"**PyBroker** ranks the buy signals by volume."
msgstr ""
"``buy_highest_volume`` 函数分配 100% 的投资组合并持有 2 个 Bar。它将 "
"``ctx.long_score`` 设置为 ``ctx.volume[-1]``，因此 **PyBroker** 会根据成交量对买入信号进行排名。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 6b775c7a01ac4e67a3d94e26bb53312c Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:112 and
msgid ""
"To limit the number of long positions that can be held at any time to "
"``1``, we set `max_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.max_long_positions>`__"
" to ``1`` in the `StrategyConfig "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__."
" This effectively buys the symbol with the highest volume."
msgstr ""
"要将同一时间可持有的多头仓位数量限制为 ``1``，我们在 `StrategyConfig "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__"
" 中将 `max_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.max_long_positions>`__"
" 设置为 ``1``。这实际上会买入成交量最高的股票代码。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 0035b012cc624fafae53725bc62fc4d1 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:654 and
msgid "Short Signals"
msgstr "空头信号"

#: ../../source/notebooks/4. 2bffbc6a1e7945c09703390e350faf64 Long Ranking
#: Short Signals.ipynb:656 and
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** can also rank short signals using `short_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score>`__,"
" where short orders are placed for the ticker symbols with the highest "
"``short_score`` values. The following example buys the ticker symbol with"
" the highest 5-day rate of change (ROC) while shorting the ticker symbol "
"with the lowest 5-day ROC:"
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker** 还可以使用 `short_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score>`__"
" 对空头信号进行排名，空头订单会下给 ``short_score`` 值最高的股票代码。以下示例买入 5 "
"日变化率（ROC）最高的股票代码，同时卖空 5 日 ROC 最低的股票代码："

